# Graticule needs NO KEYS. Every layer runs on keyless public sources.
#
# Copy this to .env only if you want one of the optional upgrades below. An
# empty .env, or no .env at all, gives you a fully working app.
#
# What runs keyless:
#   aircraft   adsb.fi / airplanes.live / adsb.lol  (community ADS-B)
#   wildfires  NASA FIRMS public archive
#   terrain    Esri world elevation
#   imagery    Esri World Imagery, OpenStreetMap, OpenTopoMap, NASA GIBS
#   ships      Digitraffic  (Baltic and Finnish waters only -- see below)
#   plus radar, alerts, quakes, volcanoes, hurricanes, satellites, TFRs,
#   airports, space weather, aurora, launches and submarine cables.


# ---- Optional: wider ship coverage ------------------------------------------
# Without this the ships layer is live but regional: Digitraffic covers the
# Baltic and Finnish waters and nothing else. There is no keyless live AIS with
# global coverage -- every worldwide feed checked wanted an account.
# Free, instant signup: https://aisstream.io
AISSTREAM_KEY=

# ---- Optional: slightly fresher wildfire detections --------------------------
# The keyless FIRMS archive is refreshed on satellite passes; the NRT API lands
# a little sooner. Coverage is the same either way (measured 2026-08-05:
# 174,637 keyless rows against 179,107 keyed), so this buys latency, not data.
# Free MAP_KEY: https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=

# ---- Optional: Cesium ion ----------------------------------------------------
# Terrain no longer needs this -- Esri's keyless world elevation is wired in by
# default. A token still adds the OSM Buildings 3D toggle (extruded building
# footprints globally), which has no keyless equivalent since OSM Buildings
# closed its anonymous tile service in April 2024.
# Free token: https://ion.cesium.com
CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# ---- Optional: Google photorealistic 3D Tiles --------------------------------
# The full Google Earth mesh. No free or keyless equivalent exists; without a
# key the Photoreal 3D toggle stays hidden.
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/tile/3d-tiles-overview
# Enable the "Map Tiles API" in your Google Cloud project.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=


# ---- Retired -----------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENSKY_* is no longer read. OpenSky's anonymous tier rate-limits to the point
# of uselessness (a plain state request returned 429 on 2026-08-05) and its
# OAuth2 client flow needed an account, so aircraft now come from the community
# ADS-B networks: no key, more aircraft, and registration plus airframe type
# that OpenSky never carried.
